{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve existing environment proxy routing**\n\nThe removed `build_opener()` included Python's default `ProxyHandler`, but these direct connections never consult `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY`, or `NO_PROXY`. Consequently all three callers (`HttpExporter`, `OTelExporter`, and `OpenSearchExporter`) now fail in environments where outbound traffic must use a proxy. Preserve proxy discovery and bypass handling, including HTTPS `CONNECT`, while applying the deadline, and add proxy regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7vl5HY","finding_digest":"5dee70e51aa88eaa00f436115306334d8936f4d42d25a73feafd7ce9b33b40e6","finding_id":"arf_v1_lxxhbzi2vchkuahugyivgbrtjw","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::http_send::proxy-routing-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::http_send::proxy-routing-preservation","line":104,"observation_digest":"c263dbfd338caade3582dc1a4f618831f3131625c0efa8cd0d97686044b315bc","observation_id":"aro_v1_yjr5x7jtrsvn4nmc3qne6ymigh","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/exporters/_common.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-15T20:00:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_72elcoyx2iigdt5f76cdn5cy54","reviewed_base_sha":"3a424e7bf6d3c768f38024007e42038eb43fcbde","reviewed_head_sha":"83efa3125aa8882f23c5542a3fa27933f5295cdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":96,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":729},"record_id":"art_v1_kihqy4h45elvdhsehtbvwc7kui","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-15T20:00:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
